  "description": "Marian, born beautiful solely to be sold at a high price, is handed over for the price of a single village. After being passed from owner to owner, he eventually finds himself in the clutches of a mad king. Three beautiful and poignant tales, each a variation on the theme of salvation.\n\n*“If only our end would come soon.”  \n“Farewell, my love.”  \n“Beneath the light of the cross, we close our eyes, blinded by its brilliance.”  \n“If I were truly God, I would forgive you. I would forgive you… and love you.”*\n\n---\n\n**Original Manhwa:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3013000001), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Salvation)\n\n##### Note: The license is expiring on July 1, 2026",
